    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.poster.avif?t=1755513576\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.webm?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.mp4?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route-planning meets tower-defense!</strong> A minimalist, real-time strategy sim where colour-matched power-lines feed ever-hungry turrets. Route the power. Zap the Starclops. Protect the colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> challenges you to design and optimize a colony defense network on a distant planet. The game takes place on a grid-based map, with colony buildings and alien hives spawning outside of your control. Your job is to defend the colony from different colored Starclops by strategically placing turrets, upgrading and connecting them to a power source of matching color. Sounds easy? Success is measured by how long you can withstand before the colony is overrun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> <strong>Real-time</strong> growing colony <strong>simulation</strong> with time controls and <strong>active pause</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Build power-lines at your own pace and rearrange resources on the fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Place and upgrade defense towers to zap more starclops with a single shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Upgrade power stations to charge your towers faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Strategically choose rewards each week to replenish your resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Unlock all <strong>maps</strong>, <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>achievements</strong> and conquer the galactic <strong>leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Enjoy the <strong>Sandbox</strong> and <strong>Custom</strong> game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> High resolution and widescreen support</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO COMING SOON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is coming soon! Be sure to <strong>wishlist and follow Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> to get a notification from Steam when the demo or playtests go live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.poster.avif?t=1755513576\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.webm?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.mp4?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.poster.avif?t=1755513576\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.webm?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.mp4?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route-planning meets tower-defense!</strong> A minimalist, real-time strategy sim where colour-matched power-lines feed ever-hungry turrets. Route the power. Zap the Starclops. Protect the colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> challenges you to design and optimize a colony defense network on a distant planet. The game takes place on a grid-based map, with colony buildings and alien hives spawning outside of your control. Your job is to defend the colony from different colored Starclops by strategically placing turrets, upgrading and connecting them to a power source of matching color. Sounds easy? Success is measured by how long you can withstand before the colony is overrun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> <strong>Real-time</strong> growing colony <strong>simulation</strong> with time controls and <strong>active pause</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Build power-lines at your own pace and rearrange resources on the fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Place and upgrade defense towers to zap more starclops with a single shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Upgrade power stations to charge your towers faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Strategically choose rewards each week to replenish your resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Unlock all <strong>maps</strong>, <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>achievements</strong> and conquer the galactic <strong>leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Enjoy the <strong>Sandbox</strong> and <strong>Custom</strong> game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1755513576\" width=18 height=16 /></span> High resolution and widescreen support</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO COMING SOON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is coming soon! Be sure to <strong>wishlist and follow Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> to get a notification from Steam when the demo or playtests go live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.poster.avif?t=1755513576\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.webm?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.mp4?t=1755513576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
